/* 区域探索事件库 卷3 / 温室·黑铁·石环·天鹅绒 / 零编号命名 */

:: MP Region Glasshouse TerraceSundialLetter [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "avery_mansion">>
<<effects>>
玻璃穹顶露台东侧的石雕日晷盘下压着一只防水羊皮信封，晷针可以左右扳动。
<<mpAmbient>><<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>雨声掩去了响动。<<else>>四周静谧无声。<</if>>
<<if ($stress or 0) gte 3500>>你深呼吸稳住心神。<<else>>你全神贯注地观察。<</if>>
你在夹层与暗槽间摸到了一枚保存完好的旧银币与信物线索。
<br><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[细致探查 (0:05)|MP Region Glasshouse Dome]]>><<pass 5>><<stress -4>><<money 250>><</link>><<lstress>>
<br>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250>>
	<<sneakicon>><<link [[巧妙开启暗格 (0:06)|MP Region Glasshouse Dome]]>><<pass 6>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><<skulduggery 2>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回主区域 (0:02)|MP Region Glasshouse Manor]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>

:: MP Region Glasshouse IceCellarBrassCan [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "avery_mansion">>
<<effects>>
地下酿造室南角的石砌冰窖里存着几块未融的坚冰，冰块下方冻着一只密封的黄铜罐。
<<mpAmbient>><<if Time.dayState is "night">>夜深无人察觉。<<else>>光线照亮了纹理。<</if>>
<<if ($exposed or 0) gte 1>>微凉的气流拂过皮肤，你借阴影掩护身形。<<else>>你整理好衣摆上前查看。<</if>>
你拨开遮挡物，发现内侧藏着前人留下的暗记与零散钱币。
<br><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[细致探查 (0:06)|MP Region Glasshouse Cellar]]>><<pass 6>><<stress -4>><<money 250>><</link>><<lstress>>
<br>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250>>
	<<sneakicon>><<link [[巧妙开启暗格 (0:07)|MP Region Glasshouse Cellar]]>><<pass 7>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><<skulduggery 2>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回主区域 (0:03)|MP Region Glasshouse Manor]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>

